Recommended stack:
- Backend: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + SQLite
- Frontend: React + Vite
- Database: SQLite for local development, PostgreSQL later for production

Suggested structure:
server/
  app/
    main.py
    database.py
    models.py
    schemas.py
    routes/
      records.py
Frontend/
  src/
    App.jsx
    main.jsx
    styles.css

Run commands:
- Backend: uvicorn server.app.main:app --reload --port 8000
- Frontend: npm install && npm run dev
